public static double CalculateAverage(List<int> values)
{
    double sum = 0;
    foreach(int value in values)
    {
        sum += value;
    }
    double average = sum / values.Count;
    // @@@ The list is not empty and the average is within expected range
    return average;
}
```

The output assert statement:

<code> Debug.Assert(values.Count != 0 && average >=0 && average <= 100 ); </code> 

